[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2462.565, "timestamp": "00:41:02", "text": "薰衣草是藍色的，對吧？是嗎？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2466.372, "timestamp": "00:41:06", "text": "是的。讓我查一下。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2470.828, "timestamp": "00:41:10", "text": "它是藍色的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2472.909, "timestamp": "00:41:12", "text": "是的，它是藍色的…"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2476.01, "timestamp": "00:41:16", "text": "是的，這就像…"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2481.511, "timestamp": "00:41:21", "text": "我想，這是一種顏色吧。它……它是一種顏色。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2489.188, "timestamp": "00:41:29", "text": "是的。是的。稍等片刻。顏色"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2493.627, "timestamp": "00:41:33", "text": "它存在於它自己的王國裡。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2497.24, "timestamp": "00:41:37", "text": "我猜是吧。啊，是的。這是家族傳統。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2501.962, "timestamp": "00:41:41", "text": "我想應該是紫色的那些吧。啊，是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2513.522, "timestamp": "00:41:53", "text": "紫色的。嗯，你還記得嗎？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2515.061, "timestamp": "00:41:55", "text": "我們以前常玩旅行遊戲…"}]